  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (A): Under AU-C 520, substantive analytical procedures evaluate financial information by analyzing plausible relationships among both financial and nonfinancial data. They require the auditor to develop an expectation and investigate significant differences from recorded amounts.
Wrong (B): Testing individual transactions for accuracy and authorization describes tests of details, not analytical procedures.
Wrong (C): Inquiry of management is a separate audit procedure, not a substantive analytical procedure.
