  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (B): AU-C 580.17 requires the auditor to reconsider the reliability of all representations when contradictory evidence is discovered. The auditor must evaluate whether the inconsistency was intentional, whether it indicates broader unreliability, and its implications for other audit areas.
